      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NW                   CHARTRIDGE           BELLINGDON                                                 (east side) 2/16                                            Bellingdon Farmhouse 2.5.78 GV                                              II House.  C17 timber framed, altered and added to in the late C19. Red brick, tiled roof with bracketted eaves.  Facing the road C19 2-storey addition, 3 bays wide.  Ground floor with central door within bargeboarded open porch flanked in either side by a 3-light window with transome and segmental brick arch.  Brick first floor band, first floor has imitation timber framing and three 2-light casements with transomes.  All windows with lattice glazing.  Rear wing C17 3 bays, with exposed timber frame and first floor oversailing on exposed joist ends, with a fourth bay added in C19.  Gabled porch on right. RCHM I p 98 MON 30 Listing NGR: SP9412405567"
    }
